# PharmEdge Design Tokens

Brand colors (preserve in UI work):

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `--primary` | `#000080` | Navy — buttons, links, sidebar |
| `--primary-strong` | `#00005C` | Deep navy — hero gradient, hover |
| `--accent` / `--secondary` | `#00BFFF` | Cyan — highlights, key CTAs |
| `--accent-deep` | `#00799C` | Tertiary teal — links, hover |
| `--background` | `#FAFAFB` | Page background |
| `--foreground` | `#0A0A14` | Body text |
| `--destructive` / `--live` | `#ef4444` | Errors, destructive actions |

## Token bridge

- Brand overrides live in `app/pharm-brand.css` (imported after shadcn preset in `globals.css`).
- Legacy aliases remain during migration: `--emerald` → `--primary`, `--ink-deep` → `--foreground`, `--header` → `--sidebar`.

## Fonts

- Body: Montserrat (`--font-montserrat`)
- Headings: Outfit (`--font-outfit`, `font-display`)

## Migration rule

- **New/edited code**: use shadcn semantic classes (`bg-primary`, `text-accent`).
- **Existing code**: legacy `var(--emerald)` etc. still valid until cleaned up.
